  "items": [
    {
      "source": "An empty <a href=\"StatementFilterFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>StatementFilterFunction</code></a> that delegates to <a href=\"ExecuteFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>ExecuteFunction</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个空的<a href=\"StatementFilterFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>StatementFilterFunction</code></a>，它委托给<a href=\"ExecuteFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>ExecuteFunction</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The filter is executed when a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscriber.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscriber</code></a> subscribes\nto the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> returned by the <a href=\"DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>.",
      "translation": "过滤器在 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Subscriber.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Subscriber</code></a>` 订阅由 `<a href=\"DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>` 返回的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a>` 时执行。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The given <code>ExecuteFunction</code> represents the next entity in the chain,\nto be invoked via <a href=\"ExecuteFunction.html#execute(io.r2dbc.spi.Statement)\"><code>ExecuteFunction.execute(Statement)</code></a> in order to\nproceed with the execution, or not invoked to short-circuit the chain.",
      "translation": "给定的 `<code>ExecuteFunction</code>` 代表链中的下一个实体，可通过 `<a href=\"ExecuteFunction.html#execute(io.r2dbc.spi.Statement)\"><code>ExecuteFunction.execute(Statement)</code></a>` 进行调用以继续执行，或者不对其进行调用以短路该链。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "StatementFilterFunctions are typically used to specify additional details on\nthe Statement objects such as <code>fetchSize</code> or key generation.",
      "translation": "StatementFilterFunctions 通常用于指定 Statement 对象的额外详细信息，例如<code>fetchSize</code>或键生成。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Apply this filter to the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a> and <a href=\"ExecuteFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>ExecuteFunction</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将此过滤器应用于给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a>和<a href=\"ExecuteFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>ExecuteFunction</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a composed filter function that first applies this filter and then\napplies the given <code>afterFilter</code>.",
      "translation": "返回一个组合的过滤函数，该函数首先应用此过滤器，然后应用给定的<code>afterFilter</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>statement</code> - the current <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>statement</code> - 当前的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>next</code> - the next <code>ExecuteFunction</code> in the chain",
      "translation": "<code>next</code> - 链中的下一个 <code>ExecuteFunction</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the filtered <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "过滤后的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result</code></a>s。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>afterFilter</code> - the filter to apply after this filter",
      "translation": "<code>afterFilter</code> - 在此过滤器之后应用的过滤器",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the composed filter.",
      "translation": "组合过滤器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This is a functional interface and can therefore be used as the assignment target for a lambda expression or method reference.",
      "translation": "这是一个功能接口，因此可用作 Lambda 表达式或方法引用的赋值目标。",
      "count": 1
    },
